<title>CHILE: SOCCER-CHILE BEAT ARMENIA 7-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHILE BEAT ARMENIA 7-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>VINA DEL MAR, Chile 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a international friendly played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Chile     7     Armenia	0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Fernando Vergara 5 and 43, Jaime Riveros 68 and 73, Cristian Castaneda 20, Fernando Cornejo 80, Pedro Gonzalez 86.</p>
